    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ambrosia Sky</i> is a first-person action game about cleaning up after a deadly, sentient contamination. Take on the role of Dalia as she returns to her home in the outer rings of Saturn to investigate strange deaths and the alien contamination that caused them.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/0762469fe95250ffaae931e3cede2518.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/3edb02e372f49617bf30821a866d62bf.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/3edb02e372f49617bf30821a866d62bf.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/3edb02e372f49617bf30821a866d62bf.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Ambrosia Sky</i>\u2019s unique gameplay blends FPS action with meditative cleaning. Use a chemical sprayer to clean fungal contamination, harvest its fruit, and upgrade your gear to survive the crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/e5fa0b3c0a6f49a6eefd4abeb575373f.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/8addb32fd3494fde58fd84fba2d7b4d4.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/8addb32fd3494fde58fd84fba2d7b4d4.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/8addb32fd3494fde58fd84fba2d7b4d4.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each species of alien fungus blurs the line between environment and enemies with their unique behaviors such as fiery explosions, electricity, or actively seeking Dalia out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/7364957f9a8830ce37f93aeb77c7ad99.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/22592ab52235914922571eb88bfde89f.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/22592ab52235914922571eb88bfde89f.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/22592ab52235914922571eb88bfde89f.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new ammo types that mimic the gameplay abilities of the fungus, upgrade your sprayer for more efficiency, and upgrade your tether to navigate and explore the unstable gravity of the Cluster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/e2c667ce9b496b713f6d7418c2c2311d.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/44602195d22d725e39c88baee8e6e208.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/44602195d22d725e39c88baee8e6e208.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/44602195d22d725e39c88baee8e6e208.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll encounter victims of the crisis and lay them to rest. These scenes reveal the mystery of the crisis and connect the disaster to the lives of the people who fell victim to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/ac273a3dec140e33067cad7cfe40d476.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/93216dd36633a14889aeaecf0202cf4b.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/93216dd36633a14889aeaecf0202cf4b.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/93216dd36633a14889aeaecf0202cf4b.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a tether device to grab objects, uncover hidden corners of the world, and explore environments with unstable gravity that can change direction and strength at any time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPMENT TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft Rains is a game studio focused on bringing world-class development experience to our work, from worldbuilding and memorable storytelling to immersive gameplay and art.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ambrosia Sky</i> is a first-person action game about cleaning up after a deadly, sentient contamination. Take on the role of Dalia as she returns to her home in the outer rings of Saturn to investigate strange deaths and the alien contamination that caused them.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/0762469fe95250ffaae931e3cede2518.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/3edb02e372f49617bf30821a866d62bf.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/3edb02e372f49617bf30821a866d62bf.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/3edb02e372f49617bf30821a866d62bf.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Ambrosia Sky</i>\u2019s unique gameplay blends FPS action with meditative cleaning. Use a chemical sprayer to clean fungal contamination, harvest its fruit, and upgrade your gear to survive the crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/e5fa0b3c0a6f49a6eefd4abeb575373f.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/8addb32fd3494fde58fd84fba2d7b4d4.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/8addb32fd3494fde58fd84fba2d7b4d4.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/8addb32fd3494fde58fd84fba2d7b4d4.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each species of alien fungus blurs the line between environment and enemies with their unique behaviors such as fiery explosions, electricity, or actively seeking Dalia out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/7364957f9a8830ce37f93aeb77c7ad99.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/22592ab52235914922571eb88bfde89f.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/22592ab52235914922571eb88bfde89f.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/22592ab52235914922571eb88bfde89f.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new ammo types that mimic the gameplay abilities of the fungus, upgrade your sprayer for more efficiency, and upgrade your tether to navigate and explore the unstable gravity of the Cluster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/e2c667ce9b496b713f6d7418c2c2311d.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/44602195d22d725e39c88baee8e6e208.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/44602195d22d725e39c88baee8e6e208.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/44602195d22d725e39c88baee8e6e208.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll encounter victims of the crisis and lay them to rest. These scenes reveal the mystery of the crisis and connect the disaster to the lives of the people who fell victim to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/ac273a3dec140e33067cad7cfe40d476.avif?t=1755018724\" width=800 height=167 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/93216dd36633a14889aeaecf0202cf4b.poster.avif?t=1755018724\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/93216dd36633a14889aeaecf0202cf4b.webm?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580160/extras/93216dd36633a14889aeaecf0202cf4b.mp4?t=1755018724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a tether device to grab objects, uncover hidden corners of the world, and explore environments with unstable gravity that can change direction and strength at any time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPMENT TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft Rains is a game studio focused on bringing world-class development experience to our work, from worldbuilding and memorable storytelling to immersive gameplay and art.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
